    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/7cf0df19f8ce697fc0582ac5a96c5070.avif?t=1755518019\" alt=\"Yellow sci-fi title card that says: Welcome to Orebits Corporation.\" width=420 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to astero\u00efd BX-142</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mining gear is calibrated. Your Clickaxe is synced. Get ready for dense rock layers, rare minerals, and... something else. Our surface scan picked up a strange anomaly beneath the crust. Work smart, and stay alert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/85516660577ac0455d03b463fef2ba41.poster.avif?t=1755518019\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/85516660577ac0455d03b463fef2ba41.webp?t=1755518019\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=220 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINE. DELIVER. RESEARCH. REPEAT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you collect is sent back to Earth. Sell your haul for profit and invest in futuristic upgrades using research points. Upgrade your gear, power up your Clickaxe, and unlock deeper parts of the tech tree with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/ff25d7aa93127f349730e451ece6d88f.poster.avif?t=1755518019\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/ff25d7aa93127f349730e451ece6d88f.webm?t=1755518019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/ff25d7aa93127f349730e451ece6d88f.mp4?t=1755518019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives for bonus rewards or reroll them if you\u2019re in the mood for something different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/8644d4b1e5561cda128b803b56e758fb.poster.avif?t=1755518019\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/8644d4b1e5561cda128b803b56e758fb.webp?t=1755518019\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=220 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIG WITH STYLE &amp; STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Clickaxe to chip away at alien stone or let it go idle after a short break. Smash through rock, gather valuable ores, and dig deeper every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mining gear starts with a Pickaxe and expands with new tools. These massive machines drop into the shaft on their own and break their way down through the mine. Powerful, durable, and completely out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/3ac35fcc1ada9ee435c0e1ac667f48b1.poster.avif?t=1755518019\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/3ac35fcc1ada9ee435c0e1ac667f48b1.webp?t=1755518019\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=220 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIRE HELP, DEPLOY TECH, STAY SHARP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before every run, pick three random Hired Help cards. Will you start with a Mining Laser, trade common ore for rarer types, or boost your gear\u2019s durability?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/dfcce7f05247a0988e74ad81f6e8dc07.poster.avif?t=1755518019\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/dfcce7f05247a0988e74ad81f6e8dc07.webp?t=1755518019\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=220 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your dig, activate powerful deployables like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shields</strong> to protect your tools from damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombs</strong> to blast through tough rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Scanners</strong> to squeeze more gold from gold ore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/052b284d2ce67f27587e2408a5424cf0.avif?t=1755518019\" width=230 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your tech to find smart combos. No two runs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR TOOLKIT FOR ASTEROID EXTRACTION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine procedurally generated asteroids using your trusty Clickaxe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy massive mining gear that smashes through alien rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick strategy-shaping Hired Help cards before each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate tech like shields, bombs, and scanners mid-run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your haul to Earth and reinvest in powerful research</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your tech tree and unlock deeper, faster runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover strange anomalies filled with sci-fi mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete or reroll objectives for bonus rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig to a glitchy guitar-only soundtrack by Joerie Dekker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy endlessly replayable runs with a blend of mystery and strategy</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GLITCHY GUITAR SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joerie Dekker\u2019s soundtrack is made entirely with distorted electric guitars. It\u2019s glitchy, gritty, and atmospheric. The perfect companion for a slow descent into the unknown. You\u2019ll feel it hum beneath every click and crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/5cb9e8b28ba9423ea0878084e4320ffc.avif?t=1755518019\" alt=\"Yellow sci-fi title card that says: Wishlist for a feature-rich future.\" width=440 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game is on the way, and your support makes a big difference. Wishlist Orebits now to unlock new features. Check the Wishlist Tierlist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/f92f9582b7b8a29dcc3225627f1a1aa9.avif?t=1755518019\" data-has-big width=800 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Orebits to your wishlist</strong> and be the first to mine the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
