ill you start with a Mining Laser, trade common ore for rarer types, or boost your gear\u2019s durability?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/dfcce7f05247a0988e74ad81f6e8dc07.poster.avif?t=1755518019\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/dfcce7f05247a0988e74ad81f6e8dc07.webp?t=1755518019\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=220 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your dig, activate powerful deployables like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shields</strong> to protect your tools from damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombs</strong> to blast through tough rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Scanners</strong> to squeeze more gold from gold ore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/052b284d2ce67f27587e2408a5424cf0.avif?t=1755518019\" width=230 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your tech to find smart combos. No two runs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR TOOLKIT FOR ASTEROID EXTRACTION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine procedurally generated asteroids using your trusty Clickaxe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy massive mining gear that smashes through alien rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick strategy-shaping Hired Help cards before each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate tech like shields, bombs, and scanners mid-run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your haul to Earth and reinvest in powerful research</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your tech tree and unlock deeper, faster runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover strange anomalies filled with sci-fi mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete or reroll objectives for bonus rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig to a glitchy guitar-only soundtrack by Joerie Dekker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy endlessly replayable runs with a blend of mystery and strategy</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GLITCHY GUITAR SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joerie Dekker\u2019s soundtrack is made entirely with distorted electric guitars. It\u2019s glitchy, gritty, and atmospheric. The perfect companion for a slow descent into the unknown. You\u2019ll feel it hum beneath every click and crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/5cb9e8b28ba9423ea0878084e4320ffc.avif?t=1755518019\" alt=\"Yellow sci-fi title card that says: Wishlist for a feature-rich future.\" width=440 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game is on the way, and your support makes a big difference. Wishlist Orebits now to unlock new features. Check the Wishlist Tierlist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/f92f9582b7b8a29dcc3225627f1a1aa9.avif?t=1755518019\" data-has-big width=800 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Orebits to your wishlist</strong> and be the first to mine the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
